1
00:00:00,135 --> 00:00:05,662
A glacial lake above Hunza bursts and takes the Karakoram Highway bridge with it.

2
00:00:06,096 --> 00:00:10,392
Pakistan tracks one hundred and thirty-one potentially dangerous lakes,

3
00:00:10,712 --> 00:00:12,046
but on many summer days,

4
00:00:12,154 --> 00:00:13,315
cloud hides them.

5
00:00:13,712 --> 00:00:15,950
NISAR's radar sees straight through.

6
00:00:16,442 --> 00:00:18,412
SARtale finds each lake,

7
00:00:18,558 --> 00:00:20,681
measures its water pass after pass,

8
00:00:20,808 --> 00:00:22,508
and prints a one-page brief.

9
00:00:22,865 --> 00:00:26,162
This summer, sixty valid looks at eleven lakes.

10
00:00:26,596 --> 00:00:28,931
SARtale, when clouds close in,

11
00:00:29,115 --> 00:00:30,700
the lakes stay in view.
